<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Materials leaves lead price unchanged.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Materials leaves lead price unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Materials Corp said on Monday it had left its selling price for lead unchanged at 116,000 yen per tonne.</p>
<p>Major Japanese smelters periodically review their selling prices, changing them in line with market prices and currency rates.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-74311</p>
</text>
